{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YGyrzV9phB1793311894.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來大致良好的天氣。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：天晴，日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:00:21.764404+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:38:15.139565+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T22:58:17.838147+00:00","content_hash":"9541562271dcba8764682af012e7edfa85b0c141810fe2cdb1ac6fa920f40038","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T23:00:21.764404+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}